{"task_id": "Mbpp/113", "solution": "def _validate_sign(string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return index of the first character to validate as digit (0 if no leading sign, 1 if sign present).\"\"\"\n    if len(string) > 0 and (string[0] == '+' or string[0] == '-'):\n        return 1\n    return 0\ndef _validate_digits(string: str, start_index: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True iff there is at least one character from start_index to end and all are digits '0'..'9'.\"\"\"\n    if start_index >= len(string):  # Enforces at least one digit after optional sign.\n        return False\n    for i in range(start_index, len(string)):\n        ch = string[i]\n        if ch < '0' or ch > '9':\n            return False\n    return True\ndef check_integer(string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Public API per SRS: returns True if string represents an integer (optional leading sign, followed by one or more digits), else False.\"\"\"\n    if string == \"\":\n        return False\n    \n    start = _validate_sign(string)\n    return _validate_digits(string, start)"}
