{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "def next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return the smallest power of two greater than or equal to n.\n    Returns 1 if n is 0, and n itself if n is already a power of two.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    power = 1\n    while power < n:\n        power *= 2\n    \n    return power"}
