{"task_id": "Mbpp/171", "solution": "class Pentagon:\n    def __init__(self, side_length: float, perimeter: float):\n        \"\"\"Domain data holder for a pentagon's side length and perimeter.\"\"\"\n        self.side_length = side_length\n        self.perimeter = perimeter\nclass PerimeterCalculator:\n    def perimeter_pentagon(self, side_length: float) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Computes the perimeter of a regular pentagon (5 * side_length).\n\n        Optionally constructs a Pentagon object internally for domain representation.\n        \"\"\"\n        perimeter_value = 5 * side_length\n        # As per design, optionally construct a Pentagon instance.\n        _ = Pentagon(side_length, perimeter_value)\n        return perimeter_value\n_calculator = PerimeterCalculator()\ndef perimeter_pentagon(side_length: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Public API: Returns the perimeter of a regular pentagon.\n\n    Delegates computation to an internal PerimeterCalculator instance.\n    \"\"\"\n    return _calculator.perimeter_pentagon(side_length)"}
