{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(tuple_input):\n    # This function determines if all elements within the input tuple have the same Python data type.\n    # It returns True if all elements share the same type, or if the tuple is empty or has one element.\n    if not tuple_input:\n        return True\n\n    first_type = type(tuple_input[0])\n    for element in tuple_input:\n        if type(element) is not first_type:\n            return False\n    return True"}
