{"task_id": "Mbpp/224", "solution": "def _to_binary(value: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Converts an integer to its binary string representation.\n    Removes the '0b' prefix for non-negative integers.\"\"\"\n    return bin(value)[2:]\ndef _count_ones(bits: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of '1' characters in a binary string.\n    Returns the integer count.\"\"\"\n    return bits.count('1')\ndef count_Set_Bits(value: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of set bits (1s) in an integer's binary representation.\n    This function delegates to internal helpers for conversion and counting.\"\"\"\n    binary_representation = _to_binary(value)\n    return _count_ones(binary_representation)"}
