{"task_id": "Mbpp/270", "solution": "def sum_even_and_even_index(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even numbers found at even zero-based indices in the input list.\n    Returns 0 if no such elements exist or for an empty list.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for index, value in enumerate(input_list):\n        if index % 2 == 0 and value % 2 == 0:\n            total_sum += value\n    return total_sum"}
