{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Computes the sum of the fifth powers of the first n even natural numbers.\n    Returns 0 if n is 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    total = 0\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        e = 2 * k\n        total += e**5\n    return int(total)"}
