{"task_id": "Mbpp/724", "solution": "def _compute_power(base: int, power: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes base ** power using arbitrary-precision arithmetic.\"\"\"\n    return base ** power\ndef _sum_digits(value: int | str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Converts value to decimal representation and returns sum of decimal digits.\"\"\"\n    return sum(int(digit) for digit in str(value))\ndef power_base_sum(base: int, power: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes base^power and returns the sum of its decimal digits.\n    This is the public API of the module.\n    \"\"\"\n    computed_value = _compute_power(base, power)\n    digit_sum = _sum_digits(computed_value)\n    return digit_sum"}
