{"task_id": "Mbpp/751", "solution": "def check_min_heap(arr):\n    \"\"\"Return True if arr represents a min-heap using 0-based indexing (left=2*i+1, right=2*i+2).\n    Returns True for empty or single-element arrays per SRS rules.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        left_child_idx = 2 * i + 1\n        right_child_idx = 2 * i + 2\n\n        if left_child_idx < n and arr[i] > arr[left_child_idx]:\n            return False\n\n        if right_child_idx < n and arr[i] > arr[right_child_idx]:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
