{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "# src/binary_search.py\n\nclass BinarySearch:\n    \"\"\"Binary-search-based algorithm to find the last (rightmost) occurrence index.\"\"\"\n    @staticmethod\n    def searchLast(arr: list, target: any) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Finds the zero-based index of the last occurrence of target in arr.\n        Returns -1 if target is not present. Assumes arr is sorted.\n        \"\"\"\n        lo = 0\n        hi = len(arr) - 1\n        result = -1\n\n        while lo <= hi:\n            mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                result = mid\n                lo = mid + 1   # Search in the right half for a later occurrence\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                lo = mid + 1\n            else: # arr[mid] > target\n                hi = mid - 1\n        return result"}
