{"task_id": "Mbpp/739", "solution": "def find_Index(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the smallest 1-based index k such that the k-th triangular number has exactly n base-10 digits.\n    This function assumes n is an integer and n >= 1, as per critical requirements overriding validation.\n    \"\"\"\n    k = 1\n    while True:\n        triangular_number = k * (k + 1) // 2\n        digit_count = len(str(triangular_number))\n        if digit_count == n:\n            return k\n        k += 1"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/128", "solution": "def _tokenize(text):\n    \"\"\"Splits text on whitespace, returning non-empty tokens.\n    Preserves order and content.\n    \"\"\"\n    return [token for token in text.split() if token]\ndef _iterable_words(seq):\n    \"\"\"Converts an iterable of strings to a list.\n    Preserves order and content, does not mutate input.\n    \"\"\"\n    return list(seq)\ndef long_words(n, words):\n    \"\"\"Returns a list of words from input with length strictly greater than n.\n    Handles both string and iterable inputs.\n    \"\"\"\n    if isinstance(words, str):\n        candidate_words = _tokenize(words)\n    else:\n        candidate_words = _iterable_words(words)\n    \n    return [word for word in candidate_words if len(word) > n]"}
